====================================================================
          PROXMOX + ISABEL 4 PUBLIC VOIP NETWORK RUNBOOK
====================================================================

PURPOSE
-------

This runbook documents the complete setup for running Issabel 4
with a PUBLIC IP through a SECOND physical Ethernet port on the
Proxmox server.

The Proxmox management/LAN network remains separate from the
Issabel public VoIP network.

